    <item>
      <title>过节送份小福利，自建 AI 聚合站点开放试用名额（已兑换结束）</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2430620</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2430620</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 11:19:14 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;端午安康！趁着假期&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;该站点目前仅作为个人学习项目，暂未开放任何充值、付费功能。恰逢端午，准备了50份体验兑换码，免费提供给有调试需求的朋友试用，全程无任何强制消费。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19312113-h-1&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19312113-h-1&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;站点访问&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;aside class=&quot;onebox allowlistedgeneric&quot; data-onebox-src=&quot;https://token.yaoshu.cc&quot;&gt;
  &lt;header class=&quot;source&quot;&gt;
      &lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/d/6/e/d6e90c7e99725659bf866b9884e70dbda610c003.png&quot; class=&quot;site-icon&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;AA85E1&quot; width=&quot;180&quot; height=&quot;180&quot;&gt;

      &lt;a href=&quot;https://token.yaoshu.cc&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;token.yaoshu.cc&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/header&gt;

  &lt;article class=&quot;onebox-body&quot;&gt;
    

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://token.yaoshu.cc&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;New API&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;Unified AI API gateway and admin dashboard.&lt;/p&gt;


  &lt;/article&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;onebox-metadata&quot;&gt;
    
    
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div style=&quot;clear: both&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/aside&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19312113-h-2&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19312113-h-2&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;支持模型列表&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GPT 系列：gpt-5.4、gpt-5.4-mini、gpt-5.5&lt;br&gt;
Claude 系列：claude-sonnet-4-6、claude-opus-4-6、claude-opus-4-7、claude-opus-4-8&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/4/6/2/462d4660df0dab07f4197f2a804e7c9c55310350.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/a0OqhOSTRQTtpCHClI37M9cq9fW.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/4/6/2/462d4660df0dab07f4197f2a804e7c9c55310350_2_690x391.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;a0OqhOSTRQTtpCHClI37M9cq9fW&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;391&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/4/6/2/462d4660df0dab07f4197f2a804e7c9c55310350_2_690x391.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/4/6/2/462d4660df0dab07f4197f2a804e7c9c55310350_2_1035x586.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/4/6/2/462d4660df0dab07f4197f2a804e7c9c55310350_2_1380x782.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;FAFAFA&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19312113-h-3&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19312113-h-3&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;体验说明&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;全站模型统一调用倍率 0.15x；&lt;br&gt;
每份兑换码内含5元体验额度，注册账号后在兑换入口提交即可实时到账。&lt;br&gt;
兑换码仅有50份，数量有限，先到先得，适合开发者、创作者短期测试、调试使用。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;最后祝大家端午顺遂，平安喜乐！&lt;/p&gt;
