    <item>
      <title>回馈社区，给大家抽个Steam小游戏~</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2430566</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2430566</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 11:07:40 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19311760-h-1&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19311760-h-1&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;游戏名：《男娘恋爱物语》&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19311760-cdk1-2&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19311760-cdk1-2&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;数量：CDK*1&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19311760-httpsstoresteampoweredcomapp3715730_lschinese-3&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19311760-httpsstoresteampoweredcomapp3715730_lschinese-3&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;商店链接：&lt;a href=&quot;https://store.steampowered.com/app/3715730/_/?l=schinese&quot; class=&quot;inline-onebox&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;Steam 上的 男娘恋爱物语&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;p-19311760-h-4&quot; class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do#p-19311760-h-4&quot; aria-label=&quot;标题链接&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;正经人谁把这游戏自己兑换污染库存啊~肯定是拿去整蛊朋友啊&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/1/3/b/13b98bea1fb04dbbeb3e49837934a8a17d53064c.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/2OuBq7xU1IC4HWfAV3A4f3jwXAo.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/3/b/13b98bea1fb04dbbeb3e49837934a8a17d53064c_2_690x398.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;2OuBq7xU1IC4HWfAV3A4f3jwXAo&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;398&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/3/b/13b98bea1fb04dbbeb3e49837934a8a17d53064c_2_690x398.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/3/b/13b98bea1fb04dbbeb3e49837934a8a17d53064c_2_1035x597.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/3/b/13b98bea1fb04dbbeb3e49837934a8a17d53064c_2_1380x796.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;565D6E&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;中奖人数：&lt;/strong&gt; 1人&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;发放形式：&lt;/strong&gt; 使用&lt;a href=&quot;https://lottery.linux.do/&quot;&gt;[LINUX DO 抽奖程序]&lt;/a&gt;抽奖，中奖后以本站私信发送CDKEY形式发放&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;参与方式：&lt;/strong&gt; 在下方对此贴进行回复。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;截止时间：&lt;/strong&gt; 2026-06-18 21:00&lt;/p&gt;
